# Everything is checked out with LF line endings, on every OS. The server
# runs these files inside Linux containers (shell entrypoints, nginx and Caddy
# config) and the setup scripts under bash, where a CRLF breaks them: Git for
# Windows' default (core.autocrlf=true) would otherwise convert on clone.
# See docs/adr/0075-windows-docker-desktop.md.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.onnx binary
